
Bind Npc 18030

On greeting
    Say "This is the Abyss of Despair Underground Level 1. Please select your transport site."
    Topic "Yes. I want to leave." do
        If player is ElMorad
            Teleport 2 at 1705 306
        Else
            Teleport 1 at 360 1742
    Topic "No. I don't want to leave." goto close
    Goto close
